- **{{ counts.bundle }} bundles** -- opinionated dependency-aggregator packages grouping skills, agents, and steering for a domain (frontend, security, a language toolchain, SpecKit, ...)
- **{{ counts.skill }} skills** -- reusable workflows, each its own package (catchup, code-review, research, verify, ...)
- **{{ counts.agent }} agents** -- sub-agents with model/tool/permission profiles (coder, pr-reviewer, adversarial-challenger, external-repo-worker)
- **{{ counts.steering }} steering packages** -- opt-in opinionated conventions (per domain and per language)
- **{{ counts.mcp }} MCP server packages** -- pre-wired Model Context Protocol servers (context7, playwright, serena, ...)
- **{{ counts.hooks }} hook packages** -- opt-in lifecycle hooks and guards (bash/git safety, branch check, git workflow, quality, merge policies, tool prefs, worktrees), cross-tool for Claude and Codex
